        "id": 1149384
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-20T18:39:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why can\u0027t you distinguish your remote controls using the more conventional vid/pid approach?\nI don\u0027t think exposing the IDC raw data is a good idea.\nIf you have speicfic properties of input devices that you\u0027d like to expose, we could consider them separately.",
      "parentUuid": "a64ee01a_f8e94508",
      "revId": "2c405892dc2289237504669f606451b1c2e7862c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
